{"blocks":[["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-5561","Microfreak/UG/09 Envelope Gen/04 Filter Amount",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","07:30 Filter-envelope sweeps"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-5617","My Notes",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","07:30 Filter-envelope sweeps"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-5635","08:45 - the filter / cutoff adjustment, makes its warbly commentary.",["Chapters","07:30 Filter-envelope sweeps","My Notes"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-5710","09:02 The bottom drops",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-5741","The second layer stops at 09:02, just after a new third-layer take begins at 08:58. The cycling envelope's Rise, Amount, Fall and Hold are reshaped from 09:00, and the main envelope's sustain changes around 09:30.",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","09:02 The bottom drops"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-5960","From 09:30 the Launchpad phrases grow denser in a low-middle range.",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","09:02 The bottom drops"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-6033","My Notes",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","09:02 The bottom drops"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-6051","09:02 - the bottom drops",["Chapters","09:02 The bottom drops","My Notes"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-6082","10:06 The pulsar returns",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-6115","Attack, decay and sustain change from 10:00 to 10:59. Spice (CC 2) and filter amount move from 11:26, and the synced LFO rate (CC 94) changes at 11:49. The second layer returns with a new take at 12:16.",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","10:06 The pulsar returns"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-6439","Microfreak/UG/11 Icon Strip/03 Touch Strip/01 Spice and Dice",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","10:06 The pulsar returns"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-6509","My Notes",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","10:06 The pulsar returns"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-6527","10:06 - the pulsar returns",["Chapters","10:06 The pulsar returns","My Notes"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-6560","13:00 The long sky's cloud",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-6595","Noise, Saturate, Spice and filter amount move together from 13:00, followed by cycling-envelope Amount at 13:30 and more Noise at 14:00. Cutoff (CC 23) changes only once in the session, at 14:19–14:22.",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","13:00 The long sky's cloud"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-6872","The synced LFO rate changes again at 14:30–14:56, Spice returns at 15:00, and the cycling envelope is reshaped from 15:30.",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","13:00 The long sky's cloud"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-7002","My Notes",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","13:00 The long sky's cloud"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-7020","13:00 - the long sky's cloud, the hair's blown face",["Chapters","13:00 The long sky's cloud","My Notes"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-7078","13:50 - a cave of spectacles receives the formula",["Chapters","13:00 The long sky's cloud","My Notes"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-7134","16:22 Layer volume rides",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-7167","The first layer dips out at 16:22 and returns by 16:57; the third layer dips from 16:50 to 17:35. The Launchpad plays its last notes at 17:53, and no knob changes are recorded from 16:00 to 18:00.",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","16:22 Layer volume rides"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-7369","My Notes",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","16:22 Layer volume rides"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-7387","17:00 - pulling back the grid, washing the curtain",["Chapters","16:22 Layer volume rides","My Notes"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-7444","Commentary",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","16:22 Layer volume rides"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-7482","17:58 — All right, that was all preset 259 Infini Pad.",["Chapters","16:22 Layer volume rides","Commentary"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-7545","18:17 Enter 8bitfi",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-7572","The commentary track marks the switch to 8bitfi at 18:17, played from the MicroFreak's own keys. Keyboard Hold (CC 64) toggles at 18:21, and the first high notes sound at 18:22.",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","18:17 Enter 8bitfi"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-7812","Key pressure runs almost continuously from here to the end. In the saved patch, pressure drives Fold at full amount and Saturate at about a third.",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","18:17 Enter 8bitfi"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-7964","Microfreak/Preset/260 8bitfi",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","18:17 Enter 8bitfi"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-8002","My Notes",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","18:17 Enter 8bitfi"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-8020","18:16 - 8bitfi starts",["Chapters","18:17 Enter 8bitfi","My Notes"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-8050","we actually first start to hear it",["18:17 Enter 8bitfi","My Notes","18:16 - 8bitfi starts"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-8092","Commentary",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","18:17 Enter 8bitfi"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-8130","18:17 — Let's try this 8bitfi lead, 260.",["Chapters","18:17 Enter 8bitfi","Commentary"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-8179","19:30 Old warbling",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-8206","The second layer fades out at 19:15 and returns at 19:30 with the live 8bitfi take; the first and third layers keep looping Infini Pad recordings under it.",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","19:30 Old warbling"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-8367","Attack and Noise move from 19:30, and sustain and decay around 20:00. The free LFO rate (CC 93) changes from 20:37; 8bitfi's saved square LFO modulates pitch.",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","19:30 Old warbling"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-8531","Microfreak/UG/08 LFO/02 LFO Rate",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","19:30 Old warbling"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-8573","My Notes",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","19:30 Old warbling"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-8591","19:35 - we first start to hear that old warbling sound, creepy",["Chapters","19:30 Old warbling","My Notes"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-8660","21:04 Low helicopter",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-8689","Low key presses begin at 21:04 under continuous pressure, and sustain and decay change at 21:07–21:12.",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","21:04 Low helicopter"]]],"format_version":5}